# Project Skills

Project-authored agent skills live in `.agents/skills/`. Cursor plugin skills load from [`.cursor/settings.json`](../settings.json): five **dotnet-agent-skills** bundles and **aspire-skills/aspire**. Plugin content is cached under the Cursor plugins directory, not under `.agents/skills/`. When a task matches a skill's description, read that skill's `SKILL.md` before proceeding. Read `AGENTS.md` for precedence when a plugin skill overlaps repository guidance.

## Path → rule → primary skills

| Path | Cursor rule | Primary skills |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `src/**/*AppHost/**` | [apphost.mdc](apphost.mdc) | `aspire` router and aspire sub-skills, `dotnet-inspect` |
| `src/Turpinverse.Web/**` | [csharp.mdc](csharp.mdc) | `blazor-blueprint`, `implementation-guardrails` |
| `canon/**`, Hugo generators in `src/Turpinverse.Tools.GenerateHugoContent/**` | [csharp.mdc](csharp.mdc) | `Category=CanonValidation` tests, [`docs/validation-rules.md`](../../docs/validation-rules.md) |
| `src/**/*.cs` | [csharp.mdc](csharp.mdc) | `implementation-guardrails`, `csharp-refactoring`, `dotnet-inspect`, `msbuild`, plugin skills per table in rule |
| `tests/**/*.cs` | [testing.mdc](testing.mdc) | `run-tests`, `code-testing`, `platform-detection` |
| `tests/Turpinverse.Site.E2ETests/**` | [testing.mdc](testing.mdc) | `playwright-cli`, Hugo site build per [`site/README.md`](../../site/README.md) |
| `**/*.md` (except `adr/`) | [markdown.mdc](markdown.mdc) | `project-documentation` |
| `adr/*.md` | [adr.mdc](adr.mdc) | `create-architectural-decision-record` |

Precedence and the full plugin catalogue: [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md) (Skills).